WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.027
Everyone was at the movie theater.

2
00:00:08.028 --> 00:00:11.902
"What movie will we see?" asked Dad.

3
00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:15.724
"I like love stories," said Emmy.

4
00:00:15.725 --> 00:00:18.679
"Yuck," said Harry.

5
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.140
"I want to see car chases!"

6
00:00:22.141 --> 00:00:25.917
"No car chases," said Mom.

7
00:00:25.918 --> 00:00:29.358
"The penguin movie looks cute."

8
00:00:29.359 --> 00:00:36.691
"Let's go to the penguin movie," said Dad.

9
00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:43.142
"Yay! Penguins!" cried Oliver.

10
00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:50.627
"Five tickets, please," said Dad.

11
00:00:50.628 --> 00:00:53.706
"Ugh," said Harry.

12
00:00:53.707 --> 00:00:59.674
"It looks like a baby movie."

13
00:00:59.675 --> 00:01:06.515
Dad bought popcorn and soda.

14
00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:10.944
The kids picked out their favorite candy.

15
00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:14.637
Then they all went into the theater.

16
00:01:14.638 --> 00:01:24.292
The theater got dark.

17
00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:27.273
The penguin movie started.

18
00:01:27.274 --> 00:01:30.950
The screen was filled with penguins.

19
00:01:30.951 --> 00:01:34.416
They were in a zoo.

20
00:01:34.417 --> 00:01:38.346
"Look at the penguins!" said Oliver.

21
00:01:38.347 --> 00:01:42.638
"This is going to be boring," thought Harry.

22
00:01:42.639 --> 00:01:51.369
Suddenly the penguins did something funny.

23
00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:57.003
They ran away from the zoo.

24
00:01:57.004 --> 00:02:01.635
The audience laughed.

25
00:02:01.636 --> 00:02:04.683
Harry smiled.

26
00:02:04.684 --> 00:02:07.980
The penguins climbed into a car.

27
00:02:07.981 --> 00:02:11.354
The audience laughed again.

28
00:02:11.355 --> 00:02:16.000
Harry laughed too.

29
00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:21.690
"Stop those penguins!" cried the zookeeper.

30
00:02:21.691 --> 00:02:24.656
Harry laughed hard.

31
00:02:24.657 --> 00:02:29.998
The zookeeper got in a jeep.

32
00:02:29.999 --> 00:02:37.419
The zookeeper drove after the penguins.

33
00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.681
"Awesome!" said Harry.

34
00:02:40.682 --> 00:02:47.024
"This movie has a car chase!"

